{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>杜如風（Helen）在今晚（17日）播出的《跟風旅行團》中，帶觀眾跟隨BLACKPINK成員Jisoo及Lisa的步伐，朝聖首爾弘大一間介紹片高達逾2,000萬點擊的「超足料三文魚麵餐廳」！究竟這碗麵有何魔力？Helen更為一款人氣Gela</p>\n<p>\n杜如風（Helen）在今晚第2集播出的《跟風旅行團》中，帶觀眾跟隨BLACKPINK成員Jisoo及Lisa的步伐，朝聖首爾弘大一間介紹片高達逾2,000萬點擊的「超足料三文魚麵餐廳」！究竟這碗麵有何魔力？Helen更為一款人氣Gelato甘願排長龍，場面墟冚！\n</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/%e6%9d%9c%e5%a6%82%e9%a2%a8-%e8%b7%9f%e9%a2%a8%e6%97%85%e8%a1%8c%e5%9c%98-%e9%a6%96%e7%88%be%e6%97%85%e9%81%8a-3544234/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">跟風旅行團第1集｜杜如風帶路首爾掃貨天堂！一文睇清4間熱店資料</a><br/>\n<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/%e8%b7%9f%e9%a2%a8%e6%97%85%e8%a1%8c%e5%9c%98-%e6%9d%9c%e5%a6%82%e9%a2%a8-%e9%9f%93%e5%9c%8b%e4%bd%8f%e5%ae%bf-3544586/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">跟風旅行團｜開箱600幾蚊入住雪嶽山森林渡假村！杜如風實測千元玻璃屋睇靚景</a></p>\n<h2>跟風旅行團第2集｜直擊弘大2,000萬View打卡熱點 杜如風實試Jisoo同款三文魚麵</h2>\n<p>今集杜如風跟隨網紅影片，來到位於弘大的「超足料三文魚麵餐廳」Mippeudong朝聖。據報這間餐廳的介紹影片在網上點擊數高達逾2,000萬，連人氣女團BLACKPINK成員Jisoo及Lisa也是常客，人氣極高！餐廳的特色是以新鮮三文魚製成「刺身」麵條，名副其實啖啖肉。杜如風在節目中先後試食了「番茄三文魚麵」、「雪蟹味噌套餐」及「豪華蓋飯」，而且款款價值均十分相宜，絕對是粉絲必到的打卡點。</p>\n<h3>Mippeudong三文魚麵餐廳<br/>\n地址 首爾市麻浦區延南洞384-7<br/>\n營業時間：每日 11:00 – 22:30</h3>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_292788416afbe2b7896be.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"跟風旅行團 杜如風 「超足料三文魚麵餐廳」Mippeudong（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_292788416afbe2b7896be.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>「超足料三文魚麵餐廳」Mippeudong（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>為食甘願排長龍 杜如風激讚杜拜朱古力麻糬Gelato</h2>\n<p>除了三文魚麵，杜如風亦到訪一間「超人氣排隊Gelato店」。為了品嚐店內名物「杜拜朱古力開心果麻糬Gelato」，她竟然也願意加入長長人龍排隊等食。這款Gelato據說能一啖集齊香、脆、煙韌三重豐富口感，令杜如風食完後也讚不絕口，大讚期待值爆燈，可見其魅力非凡。</p>\n<h3>MAMAN GELATO 網紅Gelato店<br/>\n地址：首爾市城東區聖水洞二街315-18<br/>\n營業時間：每日 11:30 – 21:00</h3>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/maman_gelato_1766554203_3794454131894204006_59092546936_20555734516afc59c95283f-1024x1024.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"跟風旅行團 杜如風 （圖片來源：maman_gelato）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"960\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/maman_gelato_1766554203_3794454131894204006_59092546936_20555734516afc59c95283f-1024x1024.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：maman_gelato）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/maman_gelato_1740813337_3578524097082310684_59092546936_21356489116afc59c78e301-1024x768.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"跟風旅行團 杜如風 （圖片來源：maman_gelato）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/maman_gelato_1740813337_3578524097082310684_59092546936_21356489116afc59c78e301-1024x768.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：maman_gelato）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>網民瘋狂洗版：跟住BLACKPINK去食！</h2>\n<p>節目介紹的美食清單引發網民熱烈討論，不少人都表示要跟隨杜如風的腳步去朝聖。網民紛紛留言：「嘩！連Jisoo同Lisa都係常客，呢間一定要去！」、「三文魚變做麵條？好想知咩味！」、「個Gelato聽個名都覺得好正好邪惡！」、「多謝Helen介紹，下次去首爾有新目標！」、「睇見都流口水，今晚即刻想食三文魚！」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_1021499946afbe2b39b2ff.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"跟風旅行團 杜如風 （圖片來源：TVB）（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_1021499946afbe2b39b2ff.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_11211093436afbe2bf94426.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"跟風旅行團 杜如風 （圖片來源：TVB）（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_11211093436afbe2bf94426.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_8054572666afbe2bb8600b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"跟風旅行團 杜如風 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_8054572666afbe2bb8600b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_11261816726afbe2ae5d366.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_11261816726afbe2ae5d366.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a></p>\n<h2>2025年新開！雪嶽山無敵靚景住宿玻璃屋頂樹屋露台</h2>\n<p>想用親民價錢享受豪華住宿？杜如風（Helen）在今晚（17日）播出的《跟風旅行團》中，就為大家開箱位於雪嶽山的森林渡假村！這裡的住宿不但有玻璃屋頂設計，可以躺在床上看風景，價錢更僅需500多到1,000零元港幣，CP值極高，究竟有幾正？詳情請看這裡：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/%e8%b7%9f%e9%a2%a8%e6%97%85%e8%a1%8c%e5%9c%98-%e6%9d%9c%e5%a6%82%e9%a2%a8-%e9%9f%93%e5%9c%8b%e4%bd%8f%e5%ae%bf-3544586/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">跟風旅行團｜開箱600幾蚊入住雪嶽山森林渡假村！杜如風實測千元玻璃屋睇靚景</a></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/9064325f-306c-49fa-b754-7a433b78ba4f_18670230236afc5dbc25259-1024x576.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"跟風旅行團 杜如風 2025年新聞的樹屋旅館！（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/9064325f-306c-49fa-b754-7a433b78ba4f_18670230236afc5dbc25259-1024x576.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>2025年新聞的樹屋旅館！（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2></h2>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T14:15:08.450630+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1555,"images":8,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T13:30:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T14:08:34.643914+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T14:08:34.643914+00:00","content_hash":"3b5f075afa4426b60e31b0f73fb8b3c532fdcaf356753249550e915ee3aec62a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}